    "summary": "JEE Advanced remains concept-integrating and lengthy; Mathematics and Physics have alternated as the toughest subject (Physics reported toughest in 2026, Mathematics in 2024). Calculus, probability, matrices and vectors/3D dominate Mathematics; mechanics (rotation, fluids), electrostatics/magnetism and modern physics dominate Physics. Chemistry is the most scoring section but physical chemistry numericals and mechanism-based organic questions have grown, while inorganic stays NCERT-anchored (coordination, p-block). Integer-type and matching questions keep guessing low; cut-offs have been around 25–30% of total marks for the common rank list.",
