      "answer": 0,
      "explanation": "U = U_f(1 − e^(−t/τ))². Setting this to U_f/2: 1 − e^(−t/τ) = 1/√2 ⇒ e^(−t/τ) = (√2 − 1)/√2 ⇒ t = τ ln(√2/(√2 − 1)) = τ ln(2 + √2).",
